		padding-top: 9px;
		color: var(--light-muted);
		font-size: 9px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.16em;
	}

	.section-content h2,
	.understanding-content h2,
	.conditions-heading h2,
	.results-heading h2,
	.domain-section h2,
